UPSTREAM GRAMMARS
=================

The TiddlyWiki5 grammar in this repository derives from, and is licensed
compatibly with, the following works:

* TiddlyWiki5 — Copyright (c) 2004-2007 Jeremy Ruston, Copyright (c) 2007-2025
  UnaMesa Association. BSD 3-Clause. The wikitext this grammar describes, and
  the licence terms above, follow TiddlyWiki5's own.
  https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5

* shikijs/textmate-grammars-themes — the HTML grammar this one embeds and
  extends. MIT.
  https://github.com/shikijs/textmate-grammars-themes

* PaulPorfiroff/atom-language-tiddlywiki5
  https://github.com/PaulPorfiroff/atom-language-tiddlywiki5

* roma0104/sublime-tid
  https://github.com/roma0104/sublime-tid

Third-party grammars vendored under `tests/` serve the embedded-language
assertions only. They carry their own licences and ship with no release; see
`.vscodeignore`.
